{"seq":3,"slug":"dead-letter-retry","title":"死信与重试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/message-queues-event-driven/patterns/dead-letter-retry","wordCount":1449,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"死信与重试\">死信与重试</h1><p>消费者一定会失败。可能是下游数据库瞬时超时，可能是依赖的接口在重启，也可能是一条数据本身有问题、无论重试多少次都处理不了。问题不在于「会不会失败」，而在于「失败之后怎么收场」——既不能让一条坏消息无限阻塞队列，也不能默默把它丢掉当无事发生。死信与重试就是这套兜底机制。它建立在<a href=\"../foundations/delivery-guarantees\">投递保证</a>的至少一次语义之上：正因为不丢，才需要一套机制处理那些反复处理不成功的消息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>重试（retry）是处理失败后再试一次，应对的是<strong>瞬时故障</strong>——网络抖动、依赖短暂不可用、锁竞争超时。死信（dead letter）是当一条消息重试到上限仍然失败，把它从主流程移走、投入一个专门的死信队列（DLQ），应对的是<strong>持久故障</strong>——数据格式错误、业务规则永远不满足、即「毒丸消息」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    M[收到消息] --&gt; P{处理}&#10;    P --&gt;|成功| OK[ack 完成]&#10;    P --&gt;|失败| R{重试次数&lt;上限?}&#10;    R --&gt;|是| W[按退避策略等待] --&gt; P&#10;    R --&gt;|否| DLQ[(死信队列)]&#10;    DLQ --&gt; H[人工排查/修复/重放]\">flowchart TD\n    M[收到消息] --&gt; P{处理}\n    P --&gt;|成功| OK[ack 完成]\n    P --&gt;|失败| R{重试次数&lt;上限?}\n    R --&gt;|是| W[按退避策略等待] --&gt; P\n    R --&gt;|否| DLQ[(死信队列)]\n    DLQ --&gt; H[人工排查/修复/重放]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>应对的故障</th>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>关键参数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>即时重试</td>\n<td>极短暂抖动</td>\n<td>立即再试</td>\n<td>次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退避重试</td>\n<td>依赖恢复中</td>\n<td>等待递增后再试</td>\n<td>初始间隔、倍数、上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死信转移</td>\n<td>持久/毒丸</td>\n<td>移入 DLQ</td>\n<td>最大重试次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>死信处理</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>人工/自动重放</td>\n<td>留存期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"重试为什么要退避\">重试为什么要退避</h2><p>最朴素的重试是「失败就立刻再试」，但这往往让情况更糟。如果下游正因为过载而失败，一堆消费者立刻齐刷刷重试，等于火上浇油，把恢复中的下游再次打垮——这叫重试风暴。</p>\n<p>正确做法是<strong>指数退避（exponential backoff）</strong>：每次重试的等待时间按倍数增长。设初始间隔为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、倍数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>、第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次重试，则等待时间为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = t_0 \\cdot b^{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>比如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 秒、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span>，重试间隔依次是 1、2、4、8、16 秒，给下游越来越多的喘息时间。但纯指数退避有个隐患：所有失败的消费者会在同一时刻醒来重试，形成同步的尖峰。解决办法是加<strong>抖动（jitter）</strong>，在等待时间上叠加一个随机量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\mathrm{random}(0,\\ t_0 \\cdot b^{n})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">random</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>抖动把重试时刻打散开，避免「惊群」。指数退避加抖动是工业界重试的标准配方，几乎所有云 SDK 的默认重试策略都采用它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"区分可重试与不可重试错误\">区分可重试与不可重试错误</h2><p>不是所有失败都该重试。盲目重试一条永远处理不了的消息，只会浪费资源并延迟它进入死信。关键是在消费代码里区分两类错误：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可重试（transient）</strong>：HTTP 503、连接超时、数据库死锁、限流拒绝。这些过一会儿可能就好了，应当退避重试。</li>\n<li><strong>不可重试（permanent）</strong>：消息体反序列化失败、必填字段缺失、违反业务前置条件（如对一个已取消的订单发货）。重试一万次结果都一样，应当<strong>立即</strong>送入死信，不必耗费重试次数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这个判断做进消费逻辑，能显著减少无谓重试。一个常见反模式是：捕获所有异常一律重试，结果一条格式错误的毒丸消息占着队列头部反复重试，把整条队列堵死——这正是死信机制要防的最坏情况。</p>\n<h2 id=\"死信队列-失败消息的归宿\">死信队列：失败消息的归宿</h2><p>当重试用尽，消息进入死信队列。DLQ 的核心价值是<strong>把失败可见化、可处置化</strong>，而不是让消息凭空消失或永久阻塞。进入 DLQ 时，应当尽量保留诊断上下文：原始消息体、失败原因、重试历史、最后一次异常堆栈。</p>\n<p>死信里的消息后续有几种处置路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DLQ[(死信队列)] --&gt; A[告警通知值班]&#10;    A --&gt; B{排查原因}&#10;    B --&gt;|代码 bug 已修| RP[修复后重放回主队列]&#10;    B --&gt;|脏数据| FIX[修正数据再重放]&#10;    B --&gt;|确实该丢弃| ARC[归档后丢弃]&#10;    B --&gt;|下游曾故障| RP\">flowchart TD\n    DLQ[(死信队列)] --&gt; A[告警通知值班]\n    A --&gt; B{排查原因}\n    B --&gt;|代码 bug 已修| RP[修复后重放回主队列]\n    B --&gt;|脏数据| FIX[修正数据再重放]\n    B --&gt;|确实该丢弃| ARC[归档后丢弃]\n    B --&gt;|下游曾故障| RP</pre><p>死信队列绝不能「设了就不管」。一个堆积的 DLQ 是系统在悄悄出问题的信号，必须配监控告警——DLQ 消息数突增往往比错误日志更早暴露故障。这部分告警策略在<a href=\"../systems/observability-ops\">监控与运维</a>中展开。重放（replay）则要特别小心：重放回主队列的消息会被再次处理，如果消费逻辑不<a href=\"../systems/ordering-idempotency\">幂等</a>，重放可能造成重复副作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"不同系统的实现差异\">不同系统的实现差异</h2><p>各家中间件对死信的支持深浅不一，选型时值得留意（详细横向对比见<a href=\"../systems/brokers-comparison\">消息中间件对比</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RabbitMQ</strong>：原生支持死信交换机（DLX），队列可声明 <code>x-dead-letter-exchange</code>，消息被拒绝、过期或超长时自动转入。重试上限常配合消息头计数实现。</li>\n<li><strong>Kafka</strong>：核心不内建 DLQ 概念，但 Kafka Connect 和 Streams 提供死信主题配置，应用层也常自建「重试主题 + 死信主题」的分层结构（如 <code>orders.retry.5s</code>、<code>orders.dlq</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>Amazon SQS</strong>：队列可直接配置 <code>RedrivePolicy</code> 指定死信队列和 <code>maxReceiveCount</code>，达到接收次数上限自动转移，是开箱即用程度最高的。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论底层机制如何，设计原则一致：瞬时失败退避重试，持久失败快速死信，死信必须可见、可重放、且重放安全。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>重试应对瞬时故障，死信应对持久/毒丸消息；二者建立在至少一次投递之上。</li>\n<li>重试用指数退避加抖动：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\mathrm{random}(0,\\ t_0 \\cdot b^{n})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">random</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，避免重试风暴与惊群。</li>\n<li>区分可重试与不可重试错误，不可重试者应立即送死信而非耗尽重试次数。</li>\n<li>死信队列让失败可见、可处置，需配监控告警；重放回主队列要求消费逻辑幂等。</li>\n<li>RabbitMQ（DLX）、Kafka（重试/死信主题）、SQS（RedrivePolicy）的实现各异，但设计原则一致。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"死信与重试","id":"死信与重试"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"重试为什么要退避","id":"重试为什么要退避"},{"level":2,"text":"区分可重试与不可重试错误","id":"区分可重试与不可重试错误"},{"level":2,"text":"死信队列：失败消息的归宿","id":"死信队列-失败消息的归宿"},{"level":2,"text":"不同系统的实现差异","id":"不同系统的实现差异"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"路由与过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/message-queues-event-driven/patterns/routing-filtering"},"next":{"title":"事件驱动架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/message-queues-event-driven/event-driven/event-driven-architecture"}}